\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 For your AI Guardians AI Incident Manager, I recommend adding an EU AI Act Regulatory Impact Assessment to each OECD incident dossier.\
The LLM should not simply determine whether an incident violates the EU AI Act. It should assess legal applicability, potential obligations, evidence of compliance gaps, incident-reporting implications, and the operational impact on affected organizations.\
The result should be a structured regulatory assessment, not an automated legal verdict.\
