\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Distinguish provider, deployer, importer, distributor, and GPAI-model provider obligations.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	9	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Distinguish legal obligations from voluntary governance recommendations.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	10	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Do not calculate penalties or assign a violation unless the supplied evidence and law support the conclusion.\
